    "detailed_description": "BLOCK CONNECTOR is a casual game with a very simple rule: connect blocks of the same colour, so even people who are not good at puzzle games can easily start playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe didn't use a game engine, but used our own library.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo need to think too much, just simply match the colours and keep defeating the boss, the polyhedron!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a slightly new puzzle game that retains the fun of existing dropout puzzles while adding its own originality, so you can play it with a fresh sensation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope it will help you pass the time!",
    "about_the_game": "BLOCK CONNECTOR is a casual game with a very simple rule: connect blocks of the same colour, so even people who are not good at puzzle games can easily start playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe didn't use a game engine, but used our own library.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo need to think too much, just simply match the colours and keep defeating the boss, the polyhedron!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a slightly new puzzle game that retains the fun of existing dropout puzzles while adding its own originality, so you can play it with a fresh sensation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope it will help you pass the time!",
